% A module in filc mode only because its function is weak (docs/gallina-backend.md,
% M4), for rocq/backend/tests/pizlonate.sh: it has no pointer class,
% and the load from a constant address still gets its check.
func(f, weak, w, [], [
    block(start, [], [
        let(tmp(v), w, load(sw), [const(16)])
    ], ret(tmp(v)))
]).
